      "quote": "Chat"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R66]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that voice chat can turn on randomly without clicking, causing accidental exposure to inappropriate content.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "OK Roblox I need you to fix this for me and possibly everybody else I was listening to a video and then voice chat suddenly turned on and I didn’t even click on it and I was watching a horror video so obviously they heard screaming cause it’s a horror🙄🙄🙄 but I need you to fix something with the voice chat because it turns on randomly so please try your hardest to fix it"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R70]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that after an update all of their child's friends are blocked from chatting, causing the child to quit Roblox.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "It made my kid all his friends are now blocked from chatting with him Roblox made. A feather at 10:08 and he got off the second he got on it wouldn’t let him chat with annyone and now he’s quitting Roblox and his 100 friends are to"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R15]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A child reports that the age gate does not work in practice, as they were placed in the 28th group despite being 13.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "The new app updates age group ideas are completely broken plus my child got put in the 28th group. Please fix your game."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R32]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the age verification system placed their child in an inappropriate group (28th) and they want it fixed.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "The new app updates age group ideas are completely broken plus my child got put in the 28th group. Please fix your game."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R71]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that age verification is broken and makes no sense for kids playing Roblox kids games.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Roblox has made horrible uptades. I know it’s trying to protect us somehow but it’s just making stuff worse. Age verification? Girl we’re playing Roblox kids games. Even if there is some weird pdf Roblox’s chat won’t alow anything weird. There is no point in Roblox kids, select or normal Roblox bro"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R22]",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports that games can be inappropriate, scary, and contain unsuitable outfits, and that the age gate did not prevent exposure.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "When i was a little kid my cousin played this so much and i begged my mom to get me the app, and now i think i should not have been playing this at that age, the game was fine at first but then the outfits are inappropriate and the games are as well! If you have like 13+ then thats fine but a 4 year old?        -ps some of the games are scary! And for some reason it hashtags everything I put and now they have a face verification…if a four year old does it and it says that they are twenty five then what do they do…plus it doesn’t take away the scary games or inappropriate games or avatars or people it just makes them not talk but they can dress weird or play weird games so in my opinion they didn’t fix anything, it might be popular but it doesn’t mean its safe plus kids spend way too much time and money to buy robux on it."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R41]",
      "area": "data",
      "claim": "A parent reports that purchased items do not appear in all game modes, raising concerns about data tracking and loss of purchased content.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Ive bought items and they dont show in certain game modes. Maybe an update to make items universal because this is real money spent."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R62]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the game forces payment to play, charging $46 after attempting to add payment info for a supposedly free game.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "I don’t know if anyone else has been having the same problem but it will not let me play without paying. When I open up the game it tells me to upgrade it, when I try to upgrade it in the App Store it tells me e that I need to add a payment option. So I go to add my card info, thankfully I added the one with no money, and I looked to see that I got a $46 charge. This is unacceptable when you guys advertise the game as free."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R16]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports that age verification updates are being used as a monetization trap and they hate the updates.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Stop adding stupid updates age verification like I REALLY hate those so please fix it"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R28]",
      "area": "developer_record",
      "claim": "A parent reports that Roblox has faced regulatory actions or fines for data collection or age verification failures.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Game won’t work on certain consoles or devices"
    }
  ]
}
